<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Application Approved</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      .password-box { background: #f0f4ff; border: 1px solid #c0d0ff; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 20px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; color: #2a4aff; }
      .warning { font-size: 13px; color: #e07000; margin-top: 10px; }
      .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Congratulations, <%= name %>! 🎉</h2>
      <p>Your application to join the Load Shedding & Power Outage Management System as a technician has been reviewed and <strong>approved</strong>.</p>
      <p>Here is your temporary login password:</p>
      <div class="password-box"><%= password %></div>
      <p class="warning">⚠️ Please log in and change your password immediately. Do not share this password with anyone.</p>
      <p>You can now log in using your registered email and the temporary password above.</p>
      <div class="footer">&copy; Load Shedding Power Outage Management System. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>